==English==

===Verb===
''to'' '''fingerbang'''

# {{vulgar}} To insert one or more digits into another person's vagina or anus for sexual pleasure.

===Noun===
'''fingerbang'''

# {{vulgar}} The insertion of one or more digits into another person's vagina or anus for sexual pleasure.

===Cultural references===
Fingerbang is the name of the band formed by Cartman in a South Park episode.

